          "body": "Stockman Rugby have confirmed the players and staff for their Dark Horse tour of Japan, which opens on Wednesday 14 October against Doshisha University in Kyoto. Head coach Ben Mowen, a former assistant with Japan's women's team, said \"I have a deep affection for the culture and people of Japan\". The club hosted the Japan U23s earlier this year, and the Queensland Reds have also announced a late-2026 tour, as have NSW Junior Rugby Union's U15 boys and U16 girls development XVs."
